The very important fact you are missing is that while instrisic speed
only gives you an extra move a fraction of the time, speed boots make
you move twice as fast as monsters.  That means you can thwack the
monster and back up before it can hit you.  Given enough room to back up
into, you can kill most anything without even getting swung at.


